error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
  --> tests/ui/application_main_replace_forgotten.rs:14:53
   |
13 |         .main(|ctl, _files| {
   |                ---
   |                |
   |                `ctl` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
   |                has type `&mut ScopedControl<'1>`
14 |             std::mem::forget(std::mem::replace(ctl, Control::new()?));
   |                                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |                                                     |
   |                                                     `ctl` escapes the closure body here
   |                                                     assignment requires that `'1` must outlive `'static`
